    "created_at": "2026-09-25T12:19:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-25T12:19:48Z",
    "body": "OK, the correct solution, which would align spec with Chrome (and be very simple to implement in Gecko) is to not consider `\"reload\"` in step 3 of [#process-scroll-behavior](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#process-scroll-behavior)",
